OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidely cloudy across the region
OL,6,Fto start with patchy rain and some
OL,7,Fhill fog across the Pennines and
OL,8,FCheviots. Turning mostly dry with the
OL,9,Fodd brighter spell through the day.
OL,10,FLight winds and near average
OL,11,Ftemperatures.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FGenerally cloudy through the
OL,14,Fevening and overnight. Dry for most
OL,15,Fareas initially but with patchy rain
OL,16,Fand mist developing later,
OL,17,Fparticularly towards dawn. Light
OL,18,Fwinds. Cool, especially in rural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
