OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cloudy day and damp start
OL,6,Fto the day with mist and patchy light
OL,7,Frain. The rain becomes more widespread
OL,8,Fthrough the day, easing overnight.
OL,9,FFeeling cool with light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FHigh
OL,12,Fpressure remains dominant. Cloudy with
OL,13,Flight rain on Sunday, but becoming
OL,14,Fdrier and brighter for Monday and
OL,15,FTuesday. Light winds and temperatures
OL,16,Faround normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
